      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "< UNIT DISASSEMBLY AND ASSEMBLY >",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        751.4636,
        265.84890060000004,
        741.7418958674033
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because there is a risk of electric shock, immediately protect the terminals of the disconnected high-voltage harness connector with insulating tape so that they are not exposed.",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        689.93592,
        558.5123519999996,
        669.1729408640886
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "INSTALLATION",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        652.98829718,
        132.11253378400002,
        642.8415916630055
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Install the Li-ion battery controller.",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        636.4159,
        228.38390399999992,
        627.1723124640885
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "WARNING:",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        621.9554559999999,
        126.04998,
        612.7118684640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "·",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        72.000012,
        599.6358843999999,
        75.654012,
        590.3922968640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To prevent electric shock, wear insulated protective gear and use insulated tools.",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        107.3416044,
        599.6358843999999,
        511.404787199999,
        590.3922968640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Li-ion battery controller includes 2 harness connectors: a high-voltage connector and a low-voltage connector . If the high-voltage harness connector is inserted  at  the  low-voltage  point,  smoking  and  component damage may occur. Be very careful not to insert the connectors at the wrong points.",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        72.00001200000003,
        553.0160643999999,
        368.33106000000026,
        484.4304728640883
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Install the battery pack upper case. EVB-204, \"BATTERY PACK UPPER CASE : Removal and Installation\".",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.14,
        413.6337123999999,
        558.4904400000013,
        392.8723324640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": ": Battery front",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "text",
      "bbox": [
        112.08,
        467.59427718,
        162.92466010000007,
        460.1037749779227
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CAUTION:",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "section_header",
      "bbox": [
        52.139616,
        387.655476,
        103.31649600000001,
        378.4118884640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Be sure to reinstall the high voltage harness clips in their original positions. If a clip is damaged, replace it with a new clip before installing.",
      "page_pdf": 216,
      "page_manual": "EVB-216",
      "section_code": "EVB",
      "label": "list_item",
      "bbox": [
        52.139616,
        376.13493600000004,
        558.5862083999996,
        355.3719568640884
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Check the following items after installing battery pack: Refer to EVB-269, \"Inspection\".",
